### Indexes

| Index Name | Type | Columns | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `bot_logs_pkey` | btree (unique) | `id` | PK index |
| `idx_bot_logs_owner` | btree | `owner_id` | Per-owner queries |
| `idx_bot_logs_created` | btree | `created_at DESC` | Recent-first ordering |
